    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what does that even mean? \"make the quiet not quiet\"? i've tried everything to change things. i tried hobbies, i tried reading, i tried just sitting here and waiting for it to pass. nothing works. it's like there's this ceiling over my head and i'm just... stuck. there's no \"small way\" to break a cage that's this heavy.",
